# Frontend Module & Database Table Analysis
> **Project:** Learning Management System v-25 (Next.js 14 — App Router)  
> **Roles covered:** Student · Instructor · Admin · Employer · Enterprise

---

## Architecture Overview

The frontend is a **Next.js App Router** application with four distinct portals:

```
app/
├── (auth)/          — Login / Signup / Forgot Password
├── (student)/       — Student portal (23 sub-routes)
├── instructor/      — Instructor portal (13 sub-routes)
├── admin/           — Admin portal (10 sub-routes)
├── employer/        — Employer landing / dashboard
└── enterprise/      — Enterprise landing / onboarding
```

---

