## Module 4 – Student Settings (`/settings`)

**Tabs / Sections**
1. **Profile** — Basic info, avatar, social links
2. **Notifications** — Channels (email/push/SMS) + learning alerts + achievement alerts
3. **Privacy** — Profile visibility, show badges/progress, employer contact, messaging
4. **Appearance** — Theme (light/dark/system), language, timezone, date/time format
